      "dom_id": "question-213139",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "Which of the following is equivalent to $7x≡1\\,(\\text{mod}\\,20)?$",
      "worked_solution": "The scalar multiplication properties of congruences state that for $k\\in Z,$ we have the following:\n\n- $a≡b\\,(\\text{mod}\\,n)\\,⟹\\,ka≡kb\\,(\\text{mod}\\,n)$\n\n- $a≡b\\,(\\text{mod}\\,n)\\,⟹\\,ka≡kb\\,(\\text{mod}\\,kn)$\n\nThe modulus equals $20$ in all statements, which suggests we'll need to use the first property.\n\nNotice that the coefficient of $x$ is $7,$ and $3\\cdot 7=21$ is one larger than the modulus. Therefore, we can reduce the coefficient of $x$ to unity as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}7x & ≡1\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,20) \\\\ 3\\cdot 7x & ≡3\\cdot 1\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,20) \\\\ 21x & ≡3\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,20) \\\\ x+20x & ≡3\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,20) \\\\ x+0x & ≡3\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,20) \\\\ x & ≡3\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,20)\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [],
      "answer_fields_complete": null,
      "result": "Incorrect",
      "proof_feedback": null,
      "html": "<div id=\"question-213139\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">2.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"213139\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>Which of the following is equivalent to <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"32\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2261\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.222em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6D\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3F\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>≡</mo><mn>1</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>mod</mtext><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mn>20</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>?</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyHard\">H</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Sun, Oct 11th @ 6:17 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span