      "raw_html": "<div class=\"question\" id=\"question-213055\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">12.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"213055\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>By the multiplicative property of congruences, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"109\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.393em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2261\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>20</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>≡</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyHard\">H</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Sun, Oct 11th @ 6:20 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:12</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: red;\">Incorrect</span></span></div></div>"
