  "canonical_examples": [
    {
      "dom_id": "step-154616",
      "name": "Example: \n                    Using the Scalar Multiplication Property",
      "problem": "Which of the following is equivalent to $3x \\equiv 1 \\: (\\textrm{mod}\\,20)?$ \n\n- $x  \\equiv 5 \\quad  (\\textrm{mod}\\,20)$\n\n- $x  \\equiv 7 \\quad  (\\textrm{mod}\\,20)$\n\n- $x  \\equiv 9 \\quad  (\\textrm{mod}\\,20)$",
      "worked_solution": "The scalar multiplication properties of congruences state that for $k \\in \\mathbb{Z},$ we have the following:\n\n- $a \\equiv b \\: (\\textrm{mod}\\,n)  \\quad \\Longrightarrow\\quad ka \\equiv kb \\:(\\textrm{mod}\\,n)$\n\n- $a \\equiv b \\: (\\textrm{mod}\\,n)  \\quad \\Longrightarrow\\quad ka \\equiv kb \\:(\\textrm{mod}\\,kn)$\n\nThe modulus equals $20$ in all statements, which suggests we'll need to use the first property.\n\nNotice that the coefficient of $x$ is $3,$ and $7\\cdot 3 = 21$ is one larger than the modulus. Therefore, we can reduce the coefficient of $x$ to unity as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3x & ≡1\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,20) \\\\ 7\\cdot 3x & ≡7\\cdot 1\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,20) \\\\ 21x & ≡7\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,20) \\\\ x+20x & ≡7\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,20) \\\\ x+0x & ≡7\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,20) \\\\ x & ≡7\\, & (\\text{mod}\\,20)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n3x \\equiv 1  \\quad \\Longrightarrow \\quad \nx \\equiv 7\\qquad  (\\textrm{mod}\\,20)\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [],
      "answer_fields_complete": null,
      "result": null,
      "proof_feedback": null,
      "html": "<div id=\"step-154616\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"154616\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"14610\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-154616\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-2\">Using the Scalar Multiplication Property</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"154616\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                  