=\"#E7-MJMAIN-2261\" x=\"11474\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMATHI-6B\" x=\"12531\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMATHI-62\" x=\"13052\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"13704\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(14093,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-6D\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-6F\" x=\"833\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-64\" x=\"1334\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMATHI-6E\" x=\"16150\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"16751\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"17140\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>Note the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>The proof of the second property is very similar. </p>\n</li>\n<li><p>We'll prove the multiplicative and exponentiation properties in future lessons. </p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n        </div>",
